---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Start an inquiry"
  description="Private quantitative coaching now begins with a short fit and scope inquiry."
  noindex
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Booking has changed</span>
    <h1>Private work now begins with fit.</h1>
    <p class="kicker">Instead of opening a calendar before I understand the problem, I now start with a short inquiry. That lets me recommend the right format, quote clearly, or refer you elsewhere without wasting your time.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href="/work-with-me#inquiry">Start an inquiry</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/work-with-me">See formats and rates</a>
    </div>
  </header>
</Base>
